OL,3,GNEWSACounty adult social care rating
OL,4,Aupgraded to 'good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire County Council's adult
OL,7,Fsocial care services have been rated as
OL,8,F"good" overall.
OL,10,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,11,Fpreviously rated the authority as
OL,12,F"requiring improvement" in August, but
OL,13,Fissued a revised rating after the
OL,14,Fcouncil requested a review.
OL,16,FThe health and social care regulator
OL,17,Fsaid it had been able to clarify
OL,18,Fevidence the authority had submitted in
OL,19,Frelation to governance, management and
OL,20,Fsustainability.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
