OL,3,GNEWSACounty adult social care rating
OL,4,Aupgraded to 'good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe assessment team found the council
OL,7,Fhad strong systems in place to monitor
OL,8,Fperformance and quality, with staff
OL,9,Fdescribing a more open and positive
OL,10,Fculture, as well as greater leadership
OL,11,Fvisibility in many areas.
